      "id": "traveler-insight",
      "title": "Traveler insight",
      "body": "In Emergency & Safety, locals often answer with a clear reply, a pointed detail, or a simple follow-up rather than a long explanation. That makes Cứu tôi với! strongest when you say it once, pause, and let the other person show the next step. Show the document, symptom, location, or item connected to the need so helpers can act faster.",
